## 💡 Quick Tips for Best Visuals
*   **Image Sizes:** Try to keep product and gallery images relatively square or in standard aspect ratios (like 4:3 or 16:9) to keep the grid perfectly clean.
*   **Compression:** Before uploading images, run them through an online image optimizer (like [tinypng.com](https://tinypng.com/)) so your pages load instantly for users on mobile connections.
